                </button>
              </h3>
              <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  We work in two-week sprint cycles. Each sprint begins with backlog grooming and story-pointing, accompanied by asynchronous daily standups in dedicated Slack/Teams channels. Every second Friday, our team conducts a live demo of working software on a staging preview environment, followed by retrospective feedback.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 3 -->
            <div class="accordion-item mb-3">
              <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingThree">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">
                  Can NovaTech integrate with existing legacy databases and on-premise servers?
                </button>
              </h3>
              <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingThree" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  Yes, absolutely. A significant portion of our enterprise work involves modernizing monoliths into event-driven microservices using the Strangler Fig pattern. We build secure hybrid connections via site-to-site VPNs, AWS Direct Connect, or reverse proxy bridges to ensure zero disruption to live operations.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 4 -->
            <div class="accordion-item mb-3">
              <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingFour">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFour">
                  Who owns the intellectual property and source code?
                </button>
              </h3>
              <div id="collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFour" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  You do. 100%. All custom code, architectural documentation, CI/CD pipelines, and assets created during our engagement are fully assigned to your business upon sprint completion. We do not lock you into proprietary hosting engines or closed platforms.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 5 -->
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingFive">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFive" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFive">
                  What post-launch SLA and maintenance guarantees do you offer?
                </button>
              </h3>
              <div id="collapseFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFive" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  We provide a standard 30-day warranty on all completed milestones to cover bug fixes at zero additional cost. Beyond that, our Growth and Enterprise retainers include 24/7 autonomous monitoring with guaranteed response times of under 15 minutes for critical severity incidents.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =========================================================================
       SECTION 9: CONTACT
       Features: Contact info with status pill, floating labels form,
       server-side validation display, and form data preservation on error.
       ========================================================================= -->
  <section id="contact" class="section-padding section-contact bg-surface-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header text-center mx-auto mb-5 scroll-reveal" data-reveal="fade-up">
        <div class="section-tag mb-2">START A CONVERSATION</div>
        <h2 class="section-title mb-3">Let's Build Something Extraordinary</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle text-secondary-theme">
          Have an architectural challenge, a product to launch, or an existing platform to modernize? Send us a note.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="row g-5">
        <!-- Contact Information (Left) -->
        <div class="col-lg-5 scroll-reveal" data-reveal="fade-right">
          <div class="card contact-info-card h-100 p-4 p-md-5">
            <div class="system-status-pill mb-4" aria-label="System operational status">
              <span class="status-indicator-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="status-text fw-medium">All Engineering Systems Operational</span>
            </div>

            <h3 class="h4 mb-3">NovaTech Headquarters</h3>
            <p class="text-secondary-theme mb-4">
              Our global team operates across North America and Europe, providing round-the-clock coverage for enterprise clients.
            </p>

            <div class="contact-details-list d-flex flex-column gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                <div class="contact-icon-circle text-primary" aria-hidden="true">
                  <i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="h6 mb-1">Global Office</h4>
                  <p class="text-secondary-theme small mb-0">100 Innovation Way, Suite 400<br>San Francisco, CA 94105</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                <div class="contact-icon-circle text-cyan" aria-hidden="true">
                  <i class="bi bi-envelope-at-fill"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="h6 mb-1">Direct Inquiries</h4>
                  <p class="text-secondary-theme small mb-0">
                    <a href="mailto:solutions@novatech.io" class="hover-link">solutions@novatech.io</a>
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                <div class="contact-icon-circle text-success" aria-hidden="true">
                  <i class="bi bi-telephone-fill"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="h6 mb-1">Phone</h4>
                  <p class="text-secondary-theme small mb-0">+1 (800) 555-NOVA (6682)</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                <div class="contact-icon-circle text-warning" aria-hidden="true">
                  <i class="bi bi-clock-fill"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="h6 mb-1">Engineering Hours</h4>
                  <p class="text-secondary-theme small mb-0">Mon – Fri: 8:00 AM – 6:00 PM PST<br>(24/7 on-call for active retainers)</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Social Links inside contact -->
            <div class="mt-auto pt-3 border-top border-secondary-subtle">
              <span class="small text-muted d-block mb-2">Connect with our core team:</span>
              <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-btn" aria-label="GitHub">
                  <i class="bi bi-github" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                </a>
                <a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-btn" aria-label="LinkedIn">
                  <i class="bi bi-linkedin" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                </a>
                <a href="https://twitter.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-btn" aria-label="X Twitter">
                  <i class="bi bi-twitter-x" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Contact Form (Right) -->
        <div class="col-lg-7 scroll-reveal" data-reveal="fade-left" data-delay="100">
          <div class="card contact-form-card p-4 p-md-5">
            <h3 class="h4 mb-2">Send an Engineering Brief</h3>
            <p class="text-secondary-theme small mb-4">
              Fill out this form and a principal engineer will review your requirements and respond within one business day.
            </p>

            <form action="/contact#contact" method="POST" novalidate id="contactForm">
              <!-- Name Input (Floating Label) -->
              <div class="form-floating mb-3">
                <input
                  type="text"
                  class="form-control <%= errors && errors.name ? 'is-invalid' : '' %>"
                  id="contactName"
                  name="name"
                  placeholder="Your Full Name"
                  value="<%= formData && formData.name ? formData.name : '' %>"
                  required
                >
                <label for="contactName">Your Full Name *</label>
                <% if (errors && errors.name) { %>
                  <div class="invalid-feedback"><%= errors.name %></div>
                <% } %>
              </div>

              <!-- Email Input (Floating Label) -->
              <div class="form-floating mb-3">
                <input
                  type="email"
                  class="form-control <%= errors && errors.email ? 'is-invalid' : '' %>"
                  id="contactEmail"
                  name="email"
                  placeholder="name@company.com"
                  value="<%= formData && formData.email ? formData.email : '' %>"
                  required
                >
                <label for="contactEmail">Corporate Email Address *</label>
                <% if (errors && errors.email) { %>
                  <div class="invalid-feedback"><%= errors.email %></div>
                <% } %>
              </div>

              <!-- Subject Input (Floating Label) -->
              <div class="form-floating mb-3">
                <input
                  type="text"
                  class="form-control"
                  id="contactSubject"
                  name="subject"
                  placeholder="Project Topic or Requirement"
                  value="<%= formData && formData.subject ? formData.subject : '' %>"
                >
                <label for="contactSubject">Subject / Scope (Optional)</label>
              </div>

              <!-- Message Input (Floating Label) -->
              <div class="form-floating mb-4">
                <textarea
                  class="form-control <%= errors && errors.message ? 'is-invalid' : '' %>"
                  id="contactMessage"
                  name="message"
                  placeholder="Describe your technical requirements..."
                  style="height: 150px"
                  required
                ><%= formData && formData.message ? formData.message : '' %></textarea>
                <label for="contactMessage">Project Details & Timeline * (min 10 characters)</label>
                <% if (errors && errors.message) { %>
                  <div class="invalid-feedback"><%= errors.message %></div>
                <% } %>
              </div>

              <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row align-items-sm-center justify-content-between gap-3">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary-gradient btn-lg d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-2">
                  <span>Submit Inquiry</span>
                  <i class="bi bi-send-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                </button>
                <span class="text-muted small">
                  <i class="bi bi-lock-fill me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                  NDAs strictly respected on all submissions.
                </span>
              </div>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

